<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tasek 6-mth net off 2.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tasek 6-mth net off 2.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  26.38   vs	  26.97</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 17.6    vs	  18.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   161.17   vs	 140.51</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    36.17   vs	  37.65</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 7.5    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Tasek Cement Bhd manufactures and sell cement and related products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
